  "text_pages": [
    "How to nominate and apply?  – Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nHow to nominate and apply?\nNomination process\nOnline application\nRequired documentation\nØstfold University College uses an online nomination and application system for incoming exchange students. The exchange student must first be nominated by the home institution using the Nomination portal. The student is then invited to register an application in the application portal (Søknadsweb). Instructions on how to use the portals may be found below.\nNomination portal\nApplication portal (Søknadsweb)\nPublished\nOct. 16, 2018 11:12 AM\n-\nLast modified\nAug. 26, 2023 10:33 AM\nE-mail this page\nShare on Facebook\nShare on X"
  ],
